<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-nanqishu" book-id="b-nanqishu-032" chapter-id="c-nanqishu-032-ruantao" source-id="s-nanqishu-032-ruantao">
  <p id="c-nanqishu-032-ruantao:line092" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-032-ruantao:line092:m0000" ref="tal_b32_si0">阮韜</persName>字<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-ruantao:line092:m0003" ref="tal_b32_si0">長明</persName>，陳留人，晉金紫光祿大夫<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-ruantao:line092:m0017" ref="03n_n2r_8rt">裕</persName>玄孫也。<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-ruantao:line092:m0022" ref="tal_b32_si0">韜</persName>少歷清官，爲南兖州別駕，刺史<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-ruantao:line092:m0037" ref="2n6_7xk_5ov">江夏王劉義恭</persName>逆求資費錢，<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-ruantao:line092:m0049" ref="tal_b32_si0">韜</persName>曰：「此朝廷物。」執不與。</p>
  <p id="c-nanqishu-032-ruantao:line094" annotation-status="in_progress" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-nanqishu-032-ruantao:line094:m0000" ref="hx8_st4_jdd">宋孝武</persName>選侍中四人，竝以風貌。<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-ruantao:line094:m0014" ref="1tc_q18_x7v">王彧</persName>、<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-ruantao:line094:m0017" ref="bst_iv3_2wx">謝莊</persName>爲一雙，<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-ruantao:line094:m0023" ref="tal_b32_si0">韜</persName>與<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-ruantao:line094:m0025" ref="pbz_pni_tco">何偃</persName>爲一雙。常充兼假。泰始末，爲征南江州長史。<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-ruantao:line094:m0048" ref="fjv_3dz_w0m">桂陽王休範</persName>在鎮，數出行遊，<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-ruantao:line094:m0061" ref="tal_b32_si0">韜</persName>性方峙，未嘗隨從。至散騎常侍，金紫光祿大夫，領<persName id="c-nanqishu-032-ruantao:line094:m0085" ref="el1_amk_djh">始興王</persName>師。永明二年，卒。</p>
</text>
